<title>USA: Pickens Cty SD, S.C., $7 mln won by Merrill Lynch. [CORRECTED 20:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>Pickens Cty SD, S.C., $7 mln won by Merrill Lynch. [CORRECTED 20:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it won $7 million of Pickens County SD, S.C., general obligation bonds, Series 1996 A, with a net interest cost of 5.26 percent.</p>
<p>(Corrects to show First Union Capital Markets bid was rejected because it was late and that Merrill Lynch &amp; Co has been named the winner. Also corrects net interest cost)</p>
<p>AMT: 7,000,000	DATE: 10/30/96	NYC Time: 1100	CUSIP: 719678</p>
<p>ISSUER: Pickens Co Sch Dist					   ST: SC</p>
